"""Competition rules text (handover_recite 11.13). Owner edits without app update."""

RULES_VERSION = "2026-10-14"

RULES: list[str] = [
    "Sanskritam runs these competitions. Apple and Google are not sponsors and are not involved in any way.",
    "Entry is free. No purchase is needed, and buying Plus does not help you win.",
    "Open to people aged 18 or over who sign in with Google or Apple. One account per person.",
    "One competition a week, in Indian Standard Time: Monday 00:00 to Sunday 23:59. Results come on the following Tuesday at 08:00.",
    "There are two divisions, Beginner and Standard. Each has its own set of three verses (short, medium and longer) and its own leaderboard. You choose your division when you first submit a verse, and it stays fixed for that week.",
    "Recite each verse from memory with the text hidden and your eyes closed. The front camera checks your eyes on your phone; no photo leaves your phone. Practice recordings never count.",
    "Each recitation is scored out of 100: words 60, order 20, flow 15 (long pauses inside the verse) and pace 5. Words and order come from speech recognition; flow and pace are measured from your recording. Only a recitation with all four parts scored counts.",
    "Your score for a verse is your best counted recitation of it. Your total for the week is the average of all three verses, so a verse you do not submit counts as zero. Only people who submit all three verses are ranked. Equal totals share a rank.",
    "You may make up to 10 counted attempts a day across the three verses.",
    "The top 3 in each division get a certificate. The monthly prize goes to first place in the Standard division's monthly table: the average of your weekly totals for the weeks that close in that month (a week you entered but did not finish counts as zero). If two people are equal, the one with more finished weeks wins, then whoever finished their last verse first. We announce the winner in the app within 3 days of the month end and send the prize within 14 days.",
    "Your best recording of each verse is kept until 30 days after the results so entries can be checked, then deleted.",
    "Entries may be checked. Playing a recording, someone else reciting, reading the text, or using more than one account means disqualification. Our decision is final.",
    "If you cannot take the eyes-closed check for a reason such as a disability, write to us and we will find another way.",
    "Questions: write to us in the app.",
]
